    "content": "# OpenCode Workflow Bundle\n\n- Workflow: `workflow/review`\n- Version: `1.0.0`\n- Profile: `portable-flat`\n- Generation fingerprint: `aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa`\n\n## Execution\nDelegate each ready phase directly to its role agent. Do not request nested delegation.\n\n## Phases\n- `phase/apply` -\u003e `role/implement`\n- `phase/verify` -\u003e `role/validate` (after: `phase/apply`)\n"
